(975335, 115379, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately says poverty.  Makes me want to go collect bottles so I can get me a Nike jacket.  Focus is a bit soft, and lighting conditions seem to have been poor this day?  I wonder if you played with the levels if that might give this a bit more punch.  Good representation of the challenge though.</td>', 'Definately says poverty.  Makes me want to go collect bottles so I can get me a Nike jacket.  Focus is a bit soft, and lighting conditions seem to have been poor this day?  I wonder if you played with the levels if that might give this a bit more punch.  Good representation of the challenge though.', '2004-10-27 01:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
