(975342, 115194, 3080, '<td valign="top">Humorous outlook on the subject.  The photo itsself seems grainy and I think that''s what you were going for, but I don''t prefer it.  usually, I would cringe at the sight of a cropped off head, but strangely enough, I feel that it works in this photo.  Kind of like a shame thing.  overall nice take onthe challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Humorous outlook on the subject.  The photo itsself seems grainy and I think that''s what you were going for, but I don''t prefer it.  usually, I would cringe at the sight of a cropped off head, but strangely enough, I feel that it works in this photo.  Kind of like a shame thing.  overall nice take onthe challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-10-27 01:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
