(975693, 114804, 24459, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, finally a very nice picture. I love the contrast and the ''appartness'' (if there is such word in English) of the three subjects. Each of them would be enough, and having them all makes this pic great. Well done.</td>', 'Ahhh, finally a very nice picture. I love the contrast and the ''appartness'' (if there is such word in English) of the three subjects. Each of them would be enough, and having them all makes this pic great. Well done.', '2004-10-27 04:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(975696, 114454, 24459, '<td valign="top">The sleeping guy does it. I love it.<br/>First second I thought the pic is not fair, as I know places where this view is just normal and there''s nothing ''poor'' about it, but then I saw the sleeping guy, and he earned you a few points :)</td>', 'The sleeping guy does it. I love it.First second I thought the pic is not fair, as I know places where this view is just normal and there''s nothing ''poor'' about it, but then I saw the sleeping guy, and he earned you a few points :)', '2004-10-27 04:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(975698, 115671, 24128, '<td valign="top">it''s a guy in good clothes who is reading a book - i don''t see the connection with poverty, reading the title i assume that there is some connection in the bible - do you really expect voters to find a bible and look up the text just to understand the pic?</td>', 'it''s a guy in good clothes who is reading a book - i don''t see the connection with poverty, reading the title i assume that there is some connection in the bible - do you really expect voters to find a bible and look up the text just to understand the pic?', '2004-10-27 04:19:27.000000', NULL, 1);
