(976077, 115603, 21367, '<td valign="top">Wow this is the way I was thinking of going myself...nothing says modern day poverty like top ramen (24 for a dollar noodles).  I actually did not enter as I could not get it just right.<br/> <br/>With poverty I think we want to depress the viewer right off.  I think this would have done better if it were done in b/w with more light through out and some grain (use a high ISO to noise it up a little).  Maybe actually have a pot of water on the stove coming to a boil  (a little steam rising) and the noodles next to it half open and part peeking out the end of the bad.<br/> <br/>Neat Idea just a little too bright (on pot and noodles) and colorful for poverty.   I lower angle might have worked a little better as well. <br/> <br/>I was actually trying to pull off the last Ramen (bare cuppard) on the self but it just did work out right.</td>', 'Wow this is the way I was thinking of going myself...nothing says modern day poverty like top ramen (24 for a dollar noodles).  I actually did not enter as I could not get it just right. With poverty I think we want to depress the viewer right off.  I think this would have done better if it were done in b/w with more light through out and some grain (use a high ISO to noise it up a little).  Maybe actually have a pot of water on the stove coming to a boil  (a little steam rising) and the noodles next to it half open and part peeking out the end of the bad. Neat Idea just a little too bright (on pot and noodles) and colorful for poverty.   I lower angle might have worked a little better as well.  I was actually trying to pull off the last Ramen (bare cuppard) on the self but it just did work out right.', '2004-10-27 11:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(976078, 114765, 26500, '<td valign="top">Hey the guy on the bill lives close to me!<br/> <br/>Anyway nice idea and good execution.  Well done.</td>', 'Hey the guy on the bill lives close to me! Anyway nice idea and good execution.  Well done.', '2004-10-27 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
