(976289, 115830, 28593, '<td valign="top">This.. this lookes posed, to me anyway.  I looke like a shot for an album cover of some sort.  Yes it''s a person laying in an alley way, but it looks like nice new shoes and jeans. With a jacket tossed over his head.  Seems like a clean subject trying to look down and out.<br/>I like the image, I just don''t think it captures the word poverty as well for me as some of the more gritty shots out there.</td>', 'This.. this lookes posed, to me anyway.  I looke like a shot for an album cover of some sort.  Yes it''s a person laying in an alley way, but it looks like nice new shoes and jeans. With a jacket tossed over his head.  Seems like a clean subject trying to look down and out.I like the image, I just don''t think it captures the word poverty as well for me as some of the more gritty shots out there.', '2004-10-27 13:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
