(976599, 115488, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It''s very evocative &amp; well-composed, but I wonder if I''d like it better in full color. I guess I understand the reason behind the selective desat - to emphasize the squalor of the building. But for me, it''s emphasizing the grass more - I find I''m looking at it more than anything. 7</td>', 'I like this a lot. It''s very evocative & well-composed, but I wonder if I''d like it better in full color. I guess I understand the reason behind the selective desat - to emphasize the squalor of the building. But for me, it''s emphasizing the grass more - I find I''m looking at it more than anything. 7', '2004-10-27 16:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
