(976736, 115835, 28593, '<td valign="top">A nice image, with good exposure.. I had to look at it for a while to  see the rusted away pipe..   The composition doesn''t present it self very clearly, it actually looks like a pretty picture, carrying some beauty.  The negative sense I would get from this is.. disrepair or decay.. not poverty.</td>', 'A nice image, with good exposure.. I had to look at it for a while to  see the rusted away pipe..   The composition doesn''t present it self very clearly, it actually looks like a pretty picture, carrying some beauty.  The negative sense I would get from this is.. disrepair or decay.. not poverty.', '2004-10-27 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(976737, 115205, 28593, '<td valign="top">um.. Poverty?  I''m sorry but I get magic elf long before I get poverty from this.  It''s a good picture and a very nice image.  But it doesn''t read as poverty to me.</td>', 'um.. Poverty?  I''m sorry but I get magic elf long before I get poverty from this.  It''s a good picture and a very nice image.  But it doesn''t read as poverty to me.', '2004-10-27 17:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
