(976742, 115522, 28593, '<td valign="top">A homeless man in front of signs selling homes that he can not afford.  That is poverty.  And I like the black and white, I get the feeling this image would not have worked nearly as effectivly in color.</td>', 'A homeless man in front of signs selling homes that he can not afford.  That is poverty.  And I like the black and white, I get the feeling this image would not have worked nearly as effectivly in color.', '2004-10-27 17:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
