(976823, 115716, 24983, '<td valign="top">all the elements are here but it seems a little static although I guess it does have a link to poverty in a physical way,. Could you not hsve him feeding the pigeons I think this could make a stronger image. BTW just wondering on the advisability of a model release in thesec circumstances. just as an aside.</td>', 'all the elements are here but it seems a little static although I guess it does have a link to poverty in a physical way,. Could you not hsve him feeding the pigeons I think this could make a stronger image. BTW just wondering on the advisability of a model release in thesec circumstances. just as an aside.', '2004-10-27 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(976825, 114454, 24642, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to think about in this photograph.  The family, the heritage, the future, dignity and so on.  Composition could be improved and the lighting is rather flat, but should a photograph be dragged down because of that if it has so many other qualities? I don''t think so.  This entry makes me think, makes me want to know more about the subject and it raises questions.  I have no idea what your intentions were but I feel there is a person holding the camera who has a lot to show to the rest of us.</td>', 'There is a lot to think about in this photograph.  The family, the heritage, the future, dignity and so on.  Composition could be improved and the lighting is rather flat, but should a photograph be dragged down because of that if it has so many other qualities? I don''t think so.  This entry makes me think, makes me want to know more about the subject and it raises questions.  I have no idea what your intentions were but I feel there is a person holding the camera who has a lot to show to the rest of us.', '2004-10-27 18:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(976826, 115833, 24983, '<td valign="top">some how there seems to be a lot of small images here this is a pity as this image has a lot of promise.</td>', 'some how there seems to be a lot of small images here this is a pity as this image has a lot of promise.', '2004-10-27 18:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
