(977944, 115716, 24962, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot, clear, clean and to the point. I like the square cropping, but could be a clue to submitter as few people have mentioned this in forums, look forward to seeing if my hunch is right at end of challenge. Good Luck.</td>', 'Like it a lot, clear, clean and to the point. I like the square cropping, but could be a clue to submitter as few people have mentioned this in forums, look forward to seeing if my hunch is right at end of challenge. Good Luck.', '2004-10-28 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(977948, 115445, 24962, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this really presents Poverty, looks like a normal 6/7 year old eating chips. Having said that, the overall effect is good, with the downward facing shot. A good effort, well in focus, perhaps too much dark on left side, but reflection is good. Best of Luck.</td>', 'Not sure if this really presents Poverty, looks like a normal 6/7 year old eating chips. Having said that, the overall effect is good, with the downward facing shot. A good effort, well in focus, perhaps too much dark on left side, but reflection is good. Best of Luck.', '2004-10-28 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(977950, 115606, 24962, '<td valign="top">Aha, poverty in Hobbiton? A great photo. Nicely composed with sharp focussing. Well done!</td>', 'Aha, poverty in Hobbiton? A great photo. Nicely composed with sharp focussing. Well done!', '2004-10-28 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(977953, 115483, 24962, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really good shot, but shame it''s so small. A larger submission would have revealed more detail and possibly more errors with focussing. Will never know? Would suggest submitting at 640x480 next time. Good Luck with it.</td>', 'This looks like a really good shot, but shame it''s so small. A larger submission would have revealed more detail and possibly more errors with focussing. Will never know? Would suggest submitting at 640x480 next time. Good Luck with it.', '2004-10-28 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(977957, 114919, 24962, '<td valign="top">This looks good, best choice was to use B&amp;W, but I find the shop window somewhat distracting, especially as your subject looks like he has just bought his trainers there. The composition is very good and focus looks spot on. Good Luck.</td>', 'This looks good, best choice was to use B&W, but I find the shop window somewhat distracting, especially as your subject looks like he has just bought his trainers there. The composition is very good and focus looks spot on. Good Luck.', '2004-10-28 16:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(978007, 115523, 16862, '<td valign="top">The framing is good, but it lacks contrast and has a snapshot feel to it. Anyway a decent photo   a 5</td>', 'The framing is good, but it lacks contrast and has a snapshot feel to it. Anyway a decent photo   a 5', '2004-10-28 16:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
