(978166, 115205, 26472, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite evoke images of poverty for me with such a clean, white sweater and fashionably cut hair. But the mysticism that surrounds it makes it seem that she is beyond that. Lovely color, focus and lighting.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite evoke images of poverty for me with such a clean, white sweater and fashionably cut hair. But the mysticism that surrounds it makes it seem that she is beyond that. Lovely color, focus and lighting.', '2004-10-28 19:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(978167, 114957, 26472, '<td valign="top">Very creative! Reminds me of an article I read called, "do what you love and you''ll probably starve." Only thing that detracts from this image is the hazyness at the bottom. Otherwise, well done! 7</td>', 'Very creative! Reminds me of an article I read called, "do what you love and you''ll probably starve." Only thing that detracts from this image is the hazyness at the bottom. Otherwise, well done! 7', '2004-10-28 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(978171, 115739, 26472, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Your use of strong lighting matches so well with the title. Well done.</td>', 'Powerful image. Your use of strong lighting matches so well with the title. Well done.', '2004-10-28 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(978174, 115557, 26472, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of blurring to capture just the date and the small amount of text at the top. Wonderful, creative shot! 9</td>', 'Excellent use of blurring to capture just the date and the small amount of text at the top. Wonderful, creative shot! 9', '2004-10-28 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(978176, 114785, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very haunting image. One of the top photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Very haunting image. One of the top photos in this challenge.', '2004-10-28 20:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(978178, 115764, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, wonderful image. Great processing, perfect composition; just really works for me.</td>', 'Wonderful, wonderful image. Great processing, perfect composition; just really works for me.', '2004-10-28 20:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(978179, 115832, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites; almost too lovely to be "impoverished", but just an excellent entry in this challenge. Maybe Poverty meets Hope challenge!</td>', 'One of my favorites; almost too lovely to be "impoverished", but just an excellent entry in this challenge. Maybe Poverty meets Hope challenge!', '2004-10-28 20:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(978180, 115841, 26472, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done and creative! Focus, tonal range, lighting, all great! 10</td>', 'Extremely well done and creative! Focus, tonal range, lighting, all great! 10', '2004-10-28 20:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(978181, 114351, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for a very moving portrait.</td>', 'Perfect title for a very moving portrait.', '2004-10-28 20:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(978184, 115719, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture and excellent title. You will score very high with this, I believe.</td>', 'Fantastic capture and excellent title. You will score very high with this, I believe.', '2004-10-28 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(978185, 115524, 26472, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite uses of selective desaturation I''ve seen. Very nice shot. 9</td>', 'One of my favorite uses of selective desaturation I''ve seen. Very nice shot. 9', '2004-10-28 20:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(978190, 115623, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think you made a great choice in your tight framing/cropping with this. Excellent.</td>', 'I think you made a great choice in your tight framing/cropping with this. Excellent.', '2004-10-28 20:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(978193, 115419, 26472, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! After looking at it for a minute I really noticed the bread and water, the "stereotypical" meal in jail. Very well done! 10</td>', 'Excellent work! After looking at it for a minute I really noticed the bread and water, the "stereotypical" meal in jail. Very well done! 10', '2004-10-28 20:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(978194, 115799, 20779, '<td valign="top">Has a great vintage or historical feel to it; excellent challenge entry. Good eye for composition within the frame, also.</td>', 'Has a great vintage or historical feel to it; excellent challenge entry. Good eye for composition within the frame, also.', '2004-10-28 20:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(978195, 115732, 26472, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! 9</td>', 'Beautiful shot! 9', '2004-10-28 20:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(978196, 115611, 20779, '<td valign="top">Excellent presentation of concept.</td>', 'Excellent presentation of concept.', '2004-10-28 20:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(978197, 115598, 20779, '<td valign="top">I guess I am missing something here; I can''t really connect poverty to the image and the quality of the photography is on par with a snapshot in my opinion.</td>', 'I guess I am missing something here; I can''t really connect poverty to the image and the quality of the photography is on par with a snapshot in my opinion.', '2004-10-28 20:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(978199, 114387, 20779, '<td valign="top">This a an exquisite portrait, but I find that the image hits me with just the opposite of poverty. To me, this young man appears rich - in health, youth, strength and hope.</td>', 'This a an exquisite portrait, but I find that the image hits me with just the opposite of poverty. To me, this young man appears rich - in health, youth, strength and hope.', '2004-10-28 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(978200, 115380, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea. I would have liked to have seen a sharper focus and a more complimentary color background, but only a personal opinion.</td>', 'Very clever idea. I would have liked to have seen a sharper focus and a more complimentary color background, but only a personal opinion.', '2004-10-28 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(978204, 115530, 20779, '<td valign="top">I found this to be a very moving image and one that is a good reminder to us - appreciate what you have today.</td>', 'I found this to be a very moving image and one that is a good reminder to us - appreciate what you have today.', '2004-10-28 20:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(978208, 115415, 20779, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative and effective take on the challenge.</td>', 'Extremely creative and effective take on the challenge.', '2004-10-28 20:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(978209, 115804, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very good concept for the challenge. I feel that the lack of focus is really hurting the image, though.</td>', 'Very good concept for the challenge. I feel that the lack of focus is really hurting the image, though.', '2004-10-28 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(978213, 115202, 20779, '<td valign="top">Well done photo; for my personal tastes, the tight crop and lack of color range detracts from it somewhat.</td>', 'Well done photo; for my personal tastes, the tight crop and lack of color range detracts from it somewhat.', '2004-10-28 20:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(978214, 115841, 20779, '<td valign="top">Cute, lighthearted take on the challenge.</td>', 'Cute, lighthearted take on the challenge.', '2004-10-28 20:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(978215, 115624, 20779, '<td valign="top">I just love the colorization appearing in this image. Well done.</td>', 'I just love the colorization appearing in this image. Well done.', '2004-10-28 20:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(978217, 115603, 20779, '<td valign="top">Cute idea for the challenge; for me personally, a little too static and out of focus.</td>', 'Cute idea for the challenge; for me personally, a little too static and out of focus.', '2004-10-28 20:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(978221, 115803, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is an appealing image. The only thing I would say in possible criticism is that the tub first struck me a abandoned or decayed, not "being used in poverty".</td>', 'This is an appealing image. The only thing I would say in possible criticism is that the tub first struck me a abandoned or decayed, not "being used in poverty".', '2004-10-28 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(978225, 115445, 20779, '<td valign="top">Charming yound child; however, for me, this isn''t saying poverty. I see a messy, average, middle class little boy with freshly cut hair, just being a "little boy".</td>', 'Charming yound child; however, for me, this isn''t saying poverty. I see a messy, average, middle class little boy with freshly cut hair, just being a "little boy".', '2004-10-28 20:41:15.000000', NULL, 1);
