(978270, 114951, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am not getting this one entrirely, but the main distraction for me is the blown out glass out of focus.</td>', 'I am not getting this one entrirely, but the main distraction for me is the blown out glass out of focus.', '2004-10-28 21:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
