(978575, 114804, 26827, '<td valign="top">For combining all the trite elements of poverty (dirty children, bleak walls, garbage) this image quite appeals to me.  Great shot.</td>', 'For combining all the trite elements of poverty (dirty children, bleak walls, garbage) this image quite appeals to me.  Great shot.', '2004-10-29 01:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(978579, 115695, 26827, '<td valign="top">Location, location, location.  That really makes this one work.  I don''t see this one talking about homelessness, just down-on-your-luckness.  I like the approach you used for this challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'Location, location, location.  That really makes this one work.  I don''t see this one talking about homelessness, just down-on-your-luckness.  I like the approach you used for this challenge.  Good job.', '2004-10-29 01:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
