(978923, 114297, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful image, just wish the focus was sharper.  the main thing i like about this image is that it goes to show that just because you might not be materially rich, it doesn''t mean you have to be miserable.  i''ve known a lot of people below the poverty line who''s lives were much richer than those above.  thanks for sharing this image, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'what a beautiful image, just wish the focus was sharper.  the main thing i like about this image is that it goes to show that just because you might not be materially rich, it doesn''t mean you have to be miserable.  i''ve known a lot of people below the poverty line who''s lives were much richer than those above.  thanks for sharing this image, and good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-29 09:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
