(978936, 114785, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really nice effort.  The exposure is moody and the elements are all good.  The nits that I have are that it all looks a little too contrived.  The newspaper is unwrinkled and the person that is sleeping under them probably wouldn''t still be holding the beverage.  I think if these people were truely sleeping on the streets, the roll of plastic would used either as a drop cloth or a covering.   I know this sounds really negative but I don''t mean it to be that way.</td>', 'Really nice effort.  The exposure is moody and the elements are all good.  The nits that I have are that it all looks a little too contrived.  The newspaper is unwrinkled and the person that is sleeping under them probably wouldn''t still be holding the beverage.  I think if these people were truely sleeping on the streets, the roll of plastic would used either as a drop cloth or a covering.   I know this sounds really negative but I don''t mean it to be that way.', '2004-10-29 09:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
