(979523, 115380, 5746, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling you were inspired by the Implied Lines Challenge :)<br/>I get the idea of the photo (I hop so). The problem is, the red fruit looks totaly different, not poor, although I guess it is the same type. At first I thought it''s a bit of carrot.<br/> <br/>Generally - it is definately different than poor child or a homeless person. Absolutely in line with the topic. Just the colours make it sooo optimistic. It''s more like "Differentiate" than "Poverty". For the idea and execution I give it 7.</td>', 'I have a feeling you were inspired by the Implied Lines Challenge :)I get the idea of the photo (I hop so). The problem is, the red fruit looks totaly different, not poor, although I guess it is the same type. At first I thought it''s a bit of carrot. Generally - it is definately different than poor child or a homeless person. Absolutely in line with the topic. Just the colours make it sooo optimistic. It''s more like "Differentiate" than "Poverty". For the idea and execution I give it 7.', '2004-10-29 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
