(979527, 115814, 5746, '<td valign="top">That is my wish as well :) To get a house in Poland is not neccessity - it''s a luxory. I like the idea, just the light blink on the roof of the "house" makes is difficult in the very first moment to guess what is it about. Maby solid background could make it stand out more. 6.</td>', 'That is my wish as well :) To get a house in Poland is not neccessity - it''s a luxory. I like the idea, just the light blink on the roof of the "house" makes is difficult in the very first moment to guess what is it about. Maby solid background could make it stand out more. 6.', '2004-10-29 16:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
