(979566, 115477, 5746, '<td valign="top">I was looking at this house for long. I have few impressions. First, I think it would''ve been helpful if the house looked more like house in which people are still living. I also think maybe a different angle could help. You cropped it also in a bit strange way (you cropped the top of the house, leaving unnecessary grass). I like it B&amp;W. 6 overall.</td>', 'I was looking at this house for long. I have few impressions. First, I think it would''ve been helpful if the house looked more like house in which people are still living. I also think maybe a different angle could help. You cropped it also in a bit strange way (you cropped the top of the house, leaving unnecessary grass). I like it B&W. 6 overall.', '2004-10-29 17:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(979587, 114620, 5746, '<td valign="top">That''s classic. Isn''t it blurred a bit? Or maybe not enough contrast:? 8.</td>', 'That''s classic. Isn''t it blurred a bit? Or maybe not enough contrast:? 8.', '2004-10-29 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(979589, 115822, 5746, '<td valign="top">That is a very very good concept. I thought of it for a while also. The shadow in front is a bit distracting, but on general it is classic purity symbol, easily understood worldwide. 9.</td>', 'That is a very very good concept. I thought of it for a while also. The shadow in front is a bit distracting, but on general it is classic purity symbol, easily understood worldwide. 9.', '2004-10-29 17:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(979590, 114537, 5746, '<td valign="top">More contrast needed here. What a pity. It would''ve been great candid photo. I guess you were far from the subject. Just too much negative space to my liking. -&gt; 6</td>', 'More contrast needed here. What a pity. It would''ve been great candid photo. I guess you were far from the subject. Just too much negative space to my liking. -> 6', '2004-10-29 17:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(979591, 115077, 5746, '<td valign="top">OMG. I wouldn''t make such direct shot. I''m not brave enough. Hard to comment, really.</td>', 'OMG. I wouldn''t make such direct shot. I''m not brave enough. Hard to comment, really.', '2004-10-29 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(979593, 115603, 5746, '<td valign="top">The fabric is far too elegant to make the "poverty" feeling. But there is a concept in it.</td>', 'The fabric is far too elegant to make the "poverty" feeling. But there is a concept in it.', '2004-10-29 17:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(979595, 114351, 5746, '<td valign="top">You cropped him a bit harshly. Very interesting and sad face. 7.</td>', 'You cropped him a bit harshly. Very interesting and sad face. 7.', '2004-10-29 17:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(979599, 115781, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. Strong message, great atmosphere. 9</td>', 'I like it a lot. Strong message, great atmosphere. 9', '2004-10-29 17:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(979601, 114544, 6519, '<td valign="top">Apart from not seeing any real any real evidence of poverty in this photo, I find it  cluttered and the reflections in the glass only add to the confusion.</td>', 'Apart from not seeing any real any real evidence of poverty in this photo, I find it  cluttered and the reflections in the glass only add to the confusion.', '2004-10-29 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(979602, 115671, 5746, '<td valign="top">Excellent.<br/>10,00</td>', 'Excellent.10,00', '2004-10-29 17:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(979607, 115734, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wow. That is striking. 10.</td>', 'Wow. That is striking. 10.', '2004-10-29 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(979609, 115488, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the effect. It was a good idea to leave the colour of the grass. There is something appealing in this picture. 9.</td>', 'I like the effect. It was a good idea to leave the colour of the grass. There is something appealing in this picture. 9.', '2004-10-29 17:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(979611, 115390, 6519, '<td valign="top">The building could do with some renovations, but the whole photo doesn''t say "poverty" to me. I''m not even sure what the actual subject is - the building or the strange cloud/smoke/light ??</td>', 'The building could do with some renovations, but the whole photo doesn''t say "poverty" to me. I''m not even sure what the actual subject is - the building or the strange cloud/smoke/light ??', '2004-10-29 17:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(979615, 114834, 6519, '<td valign="top">Now THAT truly depicts poverty - perfect photo for this challenge. I would have liked to see it at a different time of day with different light conditions, and perhaps a bit less of the river, more of the dwellings.</td>', 'Now THAT truly depicts poverty - perfect photo for this challenge. I would have liked to see it at a different time of day with different light conditions, and perhaps a bit less of the river, more of the dwellings.', '2004-10-29 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(979620, 115469, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the photo - its clear and in focus, it has an interesting point of view. However not even the title can convince me that it has anything to do with poverty.</td>', 'I like the photo - its clear and in focus, it has an interesting point of view. However not even the title can convince me that it has anything to do with poverty.', '2004-10-29 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(979625, 115077, 6519, '<td valign="top">Heartwrenching and 100% on topic. Whilst I would normally suggest to be on the level as your subject, in this case it only reinforces the point you are making. Almost makes me feel guilty to be sitting here at my nice computer.</td>', 'Heartwrenching and 100% on topic. Whilst I would normally suggest to be on the level as your subject, in this case it only reinforces the point you are making. Almost makes me feel guilty to be sitting here at my nice computer.', '2004-10-29 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(979629, 115756, 6519, '<td valign="top">The evidence of poverty is sketchy, and the great distance feels too.... safe. Getting closer to your subjects would increase the emotional involvement.</td>', 'The evidence of poverty is sketchy, and the great distance feels too.... safe. Getting closer to your subjects would increase the emotional involvement.', '2004-10-29 17:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(979631, 115679, 5746, '<td valign="top">Modern Gypsies. All with satelite dish. Poverty? I give it 7 because of the sentiment for Gypsy Life (I knew few of them quite well)</td>', 'Modern Gypsies. All with satelite dish. Poverty? I give it 7 because of the sentiment for Gypsy Life (I knew few of them quite well)', '2004-10-29 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(979632, 114503, 5746, '<td valign="top">You are brave. Great picture. I would try to focus on the lady leaving this big butt on the left aside :) 9.</td>', 'You are brave. Great picture. I would try to focus on the lady leaving this big butt on the left aside :) 9.', '2004-10-29 17:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(979634, 115692, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. The bleakness of the black and white works well, and the leading line takes my eye off into some unseen future/consequence. However, to me this photo says "alcohol" or "despair" or "isolation" etc, but not "Poverty".</td>', 'I love this photo. The bleakness of the black and white works well, and the leading line takes my eye off into some unseen future/consequence. However, to me this photo says "alcohol" or "despair" or "isolation" etc, but not "Poverty".', '2004-10-29 17:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(979635, 115755, 6519, '<td valign="top">Ummm..... different. Perhaps even interesting. But not on topic.</td>', 'Ummm..... different. Perhaps even interesting. But not on topic.', '2004-10-29 18:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(979639, 115613, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love the technical aspects of this photo (yes, I have a thing for shallow DOF) and I DO get how you''re tying it in to the topic, but I think its a little far-fetched.</td>', 'I love the technical aspects of this photo (yes, I have a thing for shallow DOF) and I DO get how you''re tying it in to the topic, but I think its a little far-fetched.', '2004-10-29 18:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(979646, 115740, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like to see someone''s eyes and find the shadows harsh in this photo. A fill-in flash would have helped here.</td>', 'I like to see someone''s eyes and find the shadows harsh in this photo. A fill-in flash would have helped here.', '2004-10-29 18:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979651, 115814, 6519, '<td valign="top">The title is the only thing in this photo that vaguely suggests the topic "Poverty". Nice clear close-up, though.</td>', 'The title is the only thing in this photo that vaguely suggests the topic "Poverty". Nice clear close-up, though.', '2004-10-29 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(979659, 114765, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very clever way to depict "Poverty" without the stereotype image of a homeless person. I like the attention to detail in the chipped plate and the rather basic and grotty looking cutlery. Well done!</td>', 'Very clever way to depict "Poverty" without the stereotype image of a homeless person. I like the attention to detail in the chipped plate and the rather basic and grotty looking cutlery. Well done!', '2004-10-29 18:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(979663, 115793, 6519, '<td valign="top">Does this show "Poverty" or "abandonment"? A human element (i.e. signs of life/occupancy) would have helped here.</td>', 'Does this show "Poverty" or "abandonment"? A human element (i.e. signs of life/occupancy) would have helped here.', '2004-10-29 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(979670, 115497, 6519, '<td valign="top">Ok shoot me, but I don''t think poor taste is "poverty". On top of that, I feel the "gem stone"  thingy is the part that should be in clear focus rather than the glove.</td>', 'Ok shoot me, but I don''t think poor taste is "poverty". On top of that, I feel the "gem stone"  thingy is the part that should be in clear focus rather than the glove.', '2004-10-29 18:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(979674, 115468, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo, I love the DOF. Alas, not even the title can make this photo fit the topic of "poverty".</td>', 'Very interesting photo, I love the DOF. Alas, not even the title can make this photo fit the topic of "poverty".', '2004-10-29 18:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(979676, 115098, 5746, '<td valign="top">Simple. 10 from me.</td>', 'Simple. 10 from me.', '2004-10-29 18:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(979677, 115830, 5746, '<td valign="top">Looks like a litography. I like the composition and fantastic texture. 10.</td>', 'Looks like a litography. I like the composition and fantastic texture. 10.', '2004-10-29 18:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(979681, 115732, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great set-up, right on topic. I only wish it wasn''t black and white - because it is so "busy" it looks confusing and color would make it easier to see.</td>', 'Great idea, great set-up, right on topic. I only wish it wasn''t black and white - because it is so "busy" it looks confusing and color would make it easier to see.', '2004-10-29 18:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(979684, 114861, 6519, '<td valign="top">Right on topic! The only thing that would have improved this (in my opinion) would have been a human element or signs of occupancy. The dull lighting works well for the mood of this photo.</td>', 'Right on topic! The only thing that would have improved this (in my opinion) would have been a human element or signs of occupancy. The dull lighting works well for the mood of this photo.', '2004-10-29 18:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(979690, 115056, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love how you concentrated on the positive aspect here, yet very clearly showing the "poverty" part, as well. The amount of blur is just right to let the subject stand out, yet still make out what the mess in the background is. Great shot!</td>', 'I love how you concentrated on the positive aspect here, yet very clearly showing the "poverty" part, as well. The amount of blur is just right to let the subject stand out, yet still make out what the mess in the background is. Great shot!', '2004-10-29 18:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(979696, 115768, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the subject. I like how he fills the frame and how unaware of the camera he appears. But the photo looks grainy and I would have liked to see this one in color, instead.</td>', 'I like the subject. I like how he fills the frame and how unaware of the camera he appears. But the photo looks grainy and I would have liked to see this one in color, instead.', '2004-10-29 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(979701, 115557, 6519, '<td valign="top">That just makes my eyes hurt.</td>', 'That just makes my eyes hurt.', '2004-10-29 18:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979703, 115391, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great subject - right on topic. Good emotional appeal. Good exposure of the dark inside of the tent. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great subject - right on topic. Good emotional appeal. Good exposure of the dark inside of the tent. I like it a lot.', '2004-10-29 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(979717, 115075, 6519, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of "Poverty". My only gripe is that the man is covered by the tree. I assume you were trying to be unobtrusive, but could you have stepped a few steps further to the left so you got all of him?</td>', 'Excellent example of "Poverty". My only gripe is that the man is covered by the tree. I assume you were trying to be unobtrusive, but could you have stepped a few steps further to the left so you got all of him?', '2004-10-29 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979720, 114832, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t see "poverty" in this photo at all.</td>', 'I don''t see "poverty" in this photo at all.', '2004-10-29 18:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(979722, 114542, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you''re trying to say with this photo and it hurts my eyes.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you''re trying to say with this photo and it hurts my eyes.', '2004-10-29 18:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(979725, 115018, 24776, '<td valign="top">good idea,</td>', 'good idea,', '2004-10-29 18:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(979728, 115695, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very much on topic, very emotional in its bleakness. The leading lines make my eyes anticipate where the person is going to walk, then come back to her. The b&amp;w works for this photo. Good job!</td>', 'Very much on topic, very emotional in its bleakness. The leading lines make my eyes anticipate where the person is going to walk, then come back to her. The b&w works for this photo. Good job!', '2004-10-29 19:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(979740, 114936, 6519, '<td valign="top">I needed the title to completely understand the photo, but I like it a lot. The desaturation treatment and all the dull colors reinforce the emotional aspects.  The rather overexposed top portion of the photo actually helps draw attention to the subjects. Good job.</td>', 'I needed the title to completely understand the photo, but I like it a lot. The desaturation treatment and all the dull colors reinforce the emotional aspects.  The rather overexposed top portion of the photo actually helps draw attention to the subjects. Good job.', '2004-10-29 19:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(979744, 115422, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, the patterns, the colors. If only the focus was better.</td>', 'I like the subject, the patterns, the colors. If only the focus was better.', '2004-10-29 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(979777, 115194, 24776, '<td valign="top">funny :)</td>', 'funny :)', '2004-10-29 19:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(979778, 115136, 14931, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture.  Doesn''t really relate to poverty though.</td>', 'beautiful picture.  Doesn''t really relate to poverty though.', '2004-10-29 19:36:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(979787, 115829, 14931, '<td valign="top">a satellite dish?  more like confused priorities, not poverty.</td>', 'a satellite dish?  more like confused priorities, not poverty.', '2004-10-29 19:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(979827, 115789, 24776, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh,</td>', 'Made me laugh,', '2004-10-29 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(979838, 115205, 25788, '<td valign="top">A great theme and a nice shot to boot.</td>', 'A great theme and a nice shot to boot.', '2004-10-29 20:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(979841, 115422, 25788, '<td valign="top">I like the depth. Great representation.</td>', 'I like the depth. Great representation.', '2004-10-29 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(979842, 115756, 24789, '<td valign="top">Great concept, however, the "looking down"  point of view on these people is slightly disturbing, not sure if it was intentional or not. I would have liked to see either a closeup of these people or a closer group shot on a better angle, still a good concept. 5, mike</td>', 'Great concept, however, the "looking down"  point of view on these people is slightly disturbing, not sure if it was intentional or not. I would have liked to see either a closeup of these people or a closer group shot on a better angle, still a good concept. 5, mike', '2004-10-29 20:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(979843, 115453, 24776, '<td valign="top">whats poverty here...?</td>', 'whats poverty here...?', '2004-10-29 20:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(979850, 114542, 26733, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it. I like the color, though.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it. I like the color, though.', '2004-10-29 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(979854, 115530, 26472, '<td valign="top">This is such an excellent and extremely powerful photo. Thank you for sharing this with us. 10</td>', 'This is such an excellent and extremely powerful photo. Thank you for sharing this with us. 10', '2004-10-29 20:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(979895, 114351, 19943, '<td valign="top">My only 10 of this challenge.  You''ve met the criteria with a face that tells a life''s worth of a story.  Maybe a little too much red though.</td>', 'My only 10 of this challenge.  You''ve met the criteria with a face that tells a life''s worth of a story.  Maybe a little too much red though.', '2004-10-29 21:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(979896, 115716, 19943, '<td valign="top">Too much green in the color.  However, I voted a (9) because of all the other qualities that you''ve captured.</td>', 'Too much green in the color.  However, I voted a (9) because of all the other qualities that you''ve captured.', '2004-10-29 21:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979897, 115098, 19943, '<td valign="top">Very unique concept for the challenge.  I liked it; voted a (9).  Nice clarity, color, and story.</td>', 'Very unique concept for the challenge.  I liked it; voted a (9).  Nice clarity, color, and story.', '2004-10-29 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979898, 115841, 19943, '<td valign="top">You''ve paid attention to details with this one.  I like the frozen action that the moths give and the dirty hands &amp; jeans add to the concept.  I voted a (9)</td>', 'You''ve paid attention to details with this one.  I like the frozen action that the moths give and the dirty hands & jeans add to the concept.  I voted a (9)', '2004-10-29 21:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(979900, 115623, 19943, '<td valign="top">The best caption of the challenge.  I like the fact that you''ve kept the homeless man as the center of the image and cropped out the people passing by.  Very cool irony from the caption.  Nice ..... I voted a (9)</td>', 'The best caption of the challenge.  I like the fact that you''ve kept the homeless man as the center of the image and cropped out the people passing by.  Very cool irony from the caption.  Nice ..... I voted a (9)', '2004-10-29 21:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(979904, 115077, 19943, '<td valign="top">THIS is a great shot (and caption) for the poverty challenge.  No "model" or "staging" going on.  Real life.  This picture hurts me to look at, but I/we need to not forget his story.  Nice capture.  I gave you a (9)</td>', 'THIS is a great shot (and caption) for the poverty challenge.  No "model" or "staging" going on.  Real life.  This picture hurts me to look at, but I/we need to not forget his story.  Nice capture.  I gave you a (9)', '2004-10-29 21:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979906, 115832, 19943, '<td valign="top">For a structure picture, I voted an (8) because of the nice color combination, clarity, and DOF.</td>', 'For a structure picture, I voted an (8) because of the nice color combination, clarity, and DOF.', '2004-10-29 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(979907, 114542, 19943, '<td valign="top">I can''t make it out at all.  Sorry</td>', 'I can''t make it out at all.  Sorry', '2004-10-29 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(979909, 115492, 19943, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus, and a flat DOF.  But I like the subject in the pic.</td>', 'A little out of focus, and a flat DOF.  But I like the subject in the pic.', '2004-10-29 21:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(979911, 115833, 19943, '<td valign="top">If only your image was larger.  However, I like the shallow DOF and focus on the boot''s toe.  Everyone can appreciate the miles those boots have walked.  Good shot</td>', 'If only your image was larger.  However, I like the shallow DOF and focus on the boot''s toe.  Everyone can appreciate the miles those boots have walked.  Good shot', '2004-10-29 21:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(979914, 114810, 19943, '<td valign="top">Ok, I get it: a dry harsh landscape and a "little engine that could" plant busting out of a crack.  I think that a backdrop without a diagonal angle would add more to the front of the image.  It is the first thing I see when looking at the pic.  DOF and focus are right on.  Nice color contrast as well.</td>', 'Ok, I get it: a dry harsh landscape and a "little engine that could" plant busting out of a crack.  I think that a backdrop without a diagonal angle would add more to the front of the image.  It is the first thing I see when looking at the pic.  DOF and focus are right on.  Nice color contrast as well.', '2004-10-29 21:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(979915, 115151, 19943, '<td valign="top">Great title, nice arrangement of subject material.  The colors are a little washed out and the top card has lost a little focus.  I gave you an (8)</td>', 'Great title, nice arrangement of subject material.  The colors are a little washed out and the top card has lost a little focus.  I gave you an (8)', '2004-10-29 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(979921, 115445, 19943, '<td valign="top">OK, your image is just painful to look at.  Little children are the most difficult part of poverty.  You nailed the eyes, focus, and DOF.  I gave you an (8).</td>', 'OK, your image is just painful to look at.  Little children are the most difficult part of poverty.  You nailed the eyes, focus, and DOF.  I gave you an (8).', '2004-10-29 22:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(979922, 115422, 19943, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus, but a great capture of sadness.  Good pic.</td>', 'A little out of focus, but a great capture of sadness.  Good pic.', '2004-10-29 22:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(979926, 115530, 19943, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.  I''m typically not a fan of B&amp;W pictures, but I like this one.  You''ve paid attention to the details and got a picture that can be stared at for a while.</td>', 'Nice setup.  I''m typically not a fan of B&W pictures, but I like this one.  You''ve paid attention to the details and got a picture that can be stared at for a while.', '2004-10-29 22:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(979928, 115401, 19943, '<td valign="top">If only the people in the background were omitted.  The age, expression and clarity of the man was right on.  This might ribbon.</td>', 'If only the people in the background were omitted.  The age, expression and clarity of the man was right on.  This might ribbon.', '2004-10-29 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(979963, 115426, 3306, '<td valign="top">Neat looking picture</td>', 'Neat looking picture', '2004-10-29 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(979964, 115077, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very Sad.</td>', 'Very Sad.', '2004-10-29 22:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(979970, 115524, 3306, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Very good DOF and lighting.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Very good DOF and lighting.', '2004-10-29 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(979971, 115600, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2004-10-29 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(979972, 115172, 3306, '<td valign="top">Touching and sad.</td>', 'Touching and sad.', '2004-10-29 23:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(979997, 115841, 22046, '<td valign="top">Clever concept. Love the bugs.</td>', 'Clever concept. Love the bugs.', '2004-10-29 23:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(980007, 115829, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very good picture, however one thing that keeps bothering me is the Satellite Dish on the roof... Makes me think of Laziness not Poverty... hmmm which one... got the dish but now no time to fix the place up, other than that, great picture.</td>', 'Very good picture, however one thing that keeps bothering me is the Satellite Dish on the roof... Makes me think of Laziness not Poverty... hmmm which one... got the dish but now no time to fix the place up, other than that, great picture.', '2004-10-29 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(980010, 115674, 27847, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great picture if only it was bigger! Just can''t see the details well.</td>', 'This could have been a great picture if only it was bigger! Just can''t see the details well.', '2004-10-29 23:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(980014, 114454, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! High marks from me on this picture!</td>', 'Nicely done! High marks from me on this picture!', '2004-10-29 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(980019, 115804, 27847, '<td valign="top">This picture would have worked well except for the focus problem that just grabs my attention. This photo would have been very dramatic if in focus.</td>', 'This picture would have worked well except for the focus problem that just grabs my attention. This photo would have been very dramatic if in focus.', '2004-10-29 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
