(980603, 115804, 28742, '<td valign="top">Uh, hmmm... Maybe there were some houses there before the fire - or are the squirrels now impoverished because of the fire?  ;-) Sorry - it''s a decent photo although maybe it''s the size, but I couldn''t tell it was related to fir or poverty.</td>', 'Uh, hmmm... Maybe there were some houses there before the fire - or are the squirrels now impoverished because of the fire?  ;-) Sorry - it''s a decent photo although maybe it''s the size, but I couldn''t tell it was related to fir or poverty.', '2004-10-30 19:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(980606, 114782, 28742, '<td valign="top">Woulda been cool if the drip stains were flowing down instead of up. ;-) Nice job.</td>', 'Woulda been cool if the drip stains were flowing down instead of up. ;-) Nice job.', '2004-10-30 19:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(980608, 115530, 28742, '<td valign="top">Now this is an excellent shot. Being more literal (and less abstract), I can definitely see a whole sad story in this photo. We actually have some poorer cats in our neighborhood - they have no forks or matches.  ;-)</td>', 'Now this is an excellent shot. Being more literal (and less abstract), I can definitely see a whole sad story in this photo. We actually have some poorer cats in our neighborhood - they have no forks or matches.  ;-)', '2004-10-30 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(980610, 115816, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the composition. Not real fond of the lighting or color.</td>', 'I like the subject and the composition. Not real fond of the lighting or color.', '2004-10-30 19:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(980612, 115607, 28742, '<td valign="top">Photographically, it''s a decent shot, but it just doesn''t evoke any emotional response from me.</td>', 'Photographically, it''s a decent shot, but it just doesn''t evoke any emotional response from me.', '2004-10-30 19:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(980613, 114804, 28742, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and focus. Nice shot.</td>', 'Good lighting and focus. Nice shot.', '2004-10-30 19:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(980616, 115445, 28742, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Maybe a little over exposed around the face under the eyes. I am wondering what a steeper angle would have done for it. Also is much more impactful in black &amp; white.</td>', 'Good shot. Maybe a little over exposed around the face under the eyes. I am wondering what a steeper angle would have done for it. Also is much more impactful in black & white.', '2004-10-30 19:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(980618, 114892, 11653, '<td valign="top">The filter takes away from the starkness of the photo. I think it would have been stronger with it.</td>', 'The filter takes away from the starkness of the photo. I think it would have been stronger with it.', '2004-10-30 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(980619, 115796, 28742, '<td valign="top">Um... poverty. yeah. ok. Are there people living under that thing? Sorry just don''t get this on any level. It''s probably me though.</td>', 'Um... poverty. yeah. ok. Are there people living under that thing? Sorry just don''t get this on any level. It''s probably me though.', '2004-10-30 19:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(980621, 115804, 11653, '<td valign="top">Focus seems too soft for my tastes.</td>', 'Focus seems too soft for my tastes.', '2004-10-30 19:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(980622, 115609, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not exactly the projects. Had you photoshop''d some graffitti on the buildings I''d have given you a higher score.  ;-)</td>', 'Not exactly the projects. Had you photoshop''d some graffitti on the buildings I''d have given you a higher score.  ;-)', '2004-10-30 19:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(980624, 115379, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for the Challenge, but a little murky.</td>', 'Nice subject for the Challenge, but a little murky.', '2004-10-30 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(980625, 115477, 28742, '<td valign="top">IMHO - Needs people. I like the lighting though.</td>', 'IMHO - Needs people. I like the lighting though.', '2004-10-30 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(980626, 115674, 11653, '<td valign="top">I''ll pass on something I learned from my shot last week. Small images don''t score well.  Use the 640 max. size if you can. Your image meets the challenge of poverty well.</td>', 'I''ll pass on something I learned from my shot last week. Small images don''t score well.  Use the 640 max. size if you can. Your image meets the challenge of poverty well.', '2004-10-30 20:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(980627, 115205, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great shot although there is not a whole lot in the pic to indicate poverty. I also feel this would have had more impact in black &amp; white. My 2 cents.</td>', 'Great shot although there is not a whole lot in the pic to indicate poverty. I also feel this would have had more impact in black & white. My 2 cents.', '2004-10-30 20:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(980628, 115522, 11653, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been stronger if you were closer to the person.</td>', 'I think this would have been stronger if you were closer to the person.', '2004-10-30 20:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(980629, 115679, 11653, '<td valign="top">I think getting closer to the subjects would make this have more impact.</td>', 'I think getting closer to the subjects would make this have more impact.', '2004-10-30 20:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(980630, 115402, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Poverty? ...or a Bachelor''s Fridge?  ;-)</td>', 'Hmmm... Poverty? ...or a Bachelor''s Fridge?  ;-)', '2004-10-30 20:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(980632, 115172, 11653, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot. Good contrasts between "rich" and "poor" elements.</td>', 'Powerful shot. Good contrasts between "rich" and "poor" elements.', '2004-10-30 20:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(980633, 115679, 28742, '<td valign="top">A little too much foreground. Good entry though.</td>', 'A little too much foreground. Good entry though.', '2004-10-30 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(980636, 115816, 11653, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more detail of the house and  fewer bushes in the front.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more detail of the house and  fewer bushes in the front.', '2004-10-30 20:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(980637, 114765, 28742, '<td valign="top">Good message construction. I thought maybe an empty milk carton and a last slice of bread would be more impactful than the dishes, but a good photo.</td>', 'Good message construction. I thought maybe an empty milk carton and a last slice of bread would be more impactful than the dishes, but a good photo.', '2004-10-30 20:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(980638, 115670, 11653, '<td valign="top">I like the image and love the colors but it doesn''t portray poverty to me.</td>', 'I like the image and love the colors but it doesn''t portray poverty to me.', '2004-10-30 20:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(980641, 115806, 28742, '<td valign="top">Subject seems a little far away. Better if you could read the sign. Pretty good shot though.</td>', 'Subject seems a little far away. Better if you could read the sign. Pretty good shot though.', '2004-10-30 20:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(980642, 114544, 11653, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective but would have liked less hand and arm and more of the sitting man.</td>', 'I like the perspective but would have liked less hand and arm and more of the sitting man.', '2004-10-30 20:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(980644, 115194, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the purple tint. Cute message, but a little too cliche'' to give a high score.</td>', 'Not a fan of the purple tint. Cute message, but a little too cliche'' to give a high score.', '2004-10-30 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(980645, 115483, 11653, '<td valign="top">Good image and use of black/white. However, image needs to be bigger. Use the 640 max if you can.</td>', 'Good image and use of black/white. However, image needs to be bigger. Use the 640 max if you can.', '2004-10-30 20:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(980646, 115720, 28742, '<td valign="top">Took me awhile to get this and I''m still not sure if I got it. Maybe if you showed some of the pages torn from the book? From a technical perspective though, I like it.</td>', 'Took me awhile to get this and I''m still not sure if I got it. Maybe if you showed some of the pages torn from the book? From a technical perspective though, I like it.', '2004-10-30 20:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(980647, 115495, 11653, '<td valign="top">Great color. I think this woudl be more powerful if you cropped it closer to the house.</td>', 'Great color. I think this woudl be more powerful if you cropped it closer to the house.', '2004-10-30 20:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(980648, 114829, 28742, '<td valign="top">Try a home equity loan from Ditech!  ;-)  Good photo, but requires too much explanation.</td>', 'Try a home equity loan from Ditech!  ;-)  Good photo, but requires too much explanation.', '2004-10-30 20:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(980649, 115557, 11653, '<td valign="top">Creative idea but image doesn''t have much zing. Maybe different lighting or a darker background would help.</td>', 'Creative idea but image doesn''t have much zing. Maybe different lighting or a darker background would help.', '2004-10-30 20:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(980650, 114454, 11653, '<td valign="top">I think more shoud have been cropped off at the top.</td>', 'I think more shoud have been cropped off at the top.', '2004-10-30 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(980651, 115695, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and lighting</td>', 'Nice lines and lighting', '2004-10-30 20:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(980652, 115832, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I have been rating low for most photos with no people in them and also rate higher for black &amp; whites for this Challenge subject, but this is great.</td>', 'Great shot! I have been rating low for most photos with no people in them and also rate higher for black & whites for this Challenge subject, but this is great.', '2004-10-30 20:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(980653, 115488, 28742, '<td valign="top">Higher score if the grass was "on the other side"  ;-)</td>', 'Higher score if the grass was "on the other side"  ;-)', '2004-10-30 20:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(980654, 115075, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. I think it is a powerful statement that the man is almost "invisible".</td>', 'Nice lighting. I think it is a powerful statement that the man is almost "invisible".', '2004-10-30 20:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(980655, 115202, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and lighting.</td>', 'Nice detail and lighting.', '2004-10-30 20:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(980656, 115494, 28742, '<td valign="top">"It''s sad when fresh water is a luxury to the hungry"<br/>Maybe shoulda said "thirsty" - and you''re only seeing the glass as half empty.  ;-) I like the lighting, the angle and even the cropping though. Good job.</td>', '"It''s sad when fresh water is a luxury to the hungry"Maybe shoulda said "thirsty" - and you''re only seeing the glass as half empty.  ;-) I like the lighting, the angle and even the cropping though. Good job.', '2004-10-30 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(980657, 115832, 11653, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures. Contrast between bright trees and bland house are striking.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures. Contrast between bright trees and bland house are striking.', '2004-10-30 20:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(980658, 115205, 11653, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, nice lighting.</td>', 'Creative idea, nice lighting.', '2004-10-30 20:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(980659, 115613, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great detail and juxtaposition. Hmmm, the "Wallace Enterprises" diminishes the message - subtracting 2 points. :-(  Interesting photo though.</td>', 'Great detail and juxtaposition. Hmmm, the "Wallace Enterprises" diminishes the message - subtracting 2 points. :-(  Interesting photo though.', '2004-10-30 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(980660, 115793, 11653, '<td valign="top">Good colors. I would have left more sky and cut off more of the yard.</td>', 'Good colors. I would have left more sky and cut off more of the yard.', '2004-10-30 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(980661, 115768, 11653, '<td valign="top">Good capture of emotion on his face.</td>', 'Good capture of emotion on his face.', '2004-10-30 20:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(980663, 114537, 11653, '<td valign="top">The car in upper right is distracting for me. Would have been more powerful  if you could have gotten closer to the man.</td>', 'The car in upper right is distracting for me. Would have been more powerful  if you could have gotten closer to the man.', '2004-10-30 20:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(980664, 115151, 28742, '<td valign="top">Stop buying colored rubber bands and sell your inkjet printer and start paying off those debts! ;-)</td>', 'Stop buying colored rubber bands and sell your inkjet printer and start paying off those debts! ;-)', '2004-10-30 20:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(980666, 115799, 11653, '<td valign="top">I think this would have had more impact if the entire image was darker</td>', 'I think this would have had more impact if the entire image was darker', '2004-10-30 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(980667, 115612, 11653, '<td valign="top">Great capture of her face and emotion.</td>', 'Great capture of her face and emotion.', '2004-10-30 20:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(980668, 115814, 28742, '<td valign="top">Took me awhile to identify the object. Coulda made it red then it would have had more of an instant impression.</td>', 'Took me awhile to identify the object. Coulda made it red then it would have had more of an instant impression.', '2004-10-30 20:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
