(981644, 115422, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very much meets the idea of "poverty".  I love how, even in the hardest circumstances, human beings find joy in color, and I like that you''ve shown that here.  I do wish that some element of the picture was a bit more in focus.</td>', 'Very much meets the idea of "poverty".  I love how, even in the hardest circumstances, human beings find joy in color, and I like that you''ve shown that here.  I do wish that some element of the picture was a bit more in focus.', '2004-10-31 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
