(981652, 114620, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very real and very harsh picture.  Accurately depicts an impoverished existance.  Photography-wise, the landscape is nicely exposed, but the shadows on the children''s faces are a bit too dark.</td>', 'Very real and very harsh picture.  Accurately depicts an impoverished existance.  Photography-wise, the landscape is nicely exposed, but the shadows on the children''s faces are a bit too dark.', '2004-10-31 16:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
