(981965, 115841, 24511, '<td valign="top">I loved the symbolism of poverty wearing used clothing.  Your depiction of a hand pinching an empty pocket had me thinking criminal pick pocket as a survival course of action.  The substance on the hands adds character and the dark background enhances the shapes and focus on the various items.  I found the insects distracting .  The black background made me think that this was a created art photo.  The hand was my favorite part of the photo.  Thanks.</td>', 'I loved the symbolism of poverty wearing used clothing.  Your depiction of a hand pinching an empty pocket had me thinking criminal pick pocket as a survival course of action.  The substance on the hands adds character and the dark background enhances the shapes and focus on the various items.  I found the insects distracting .  The black background made me think that this was a created art photo.  The hand was my favorite part of the photo.  Thanks.', '2004-10-31 23:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(981986, 115390, 24511, '<td valign="top">What a great nuclear explosion cloud.  I appreciated the building lines.  Mostly I loved the window frame with the lighting within.  After voting for 15 minutes, I am having trouble defining for myself and understanding what others see as poverty.  I will surprise myself by voting a 10 this time around.  7 for your anti-powerty slogan.</td>', 'What a great nuclear explosion cloud.  I appreciated the building lines.  Mostly I loved the window frame with the lighting within.  After voting for 15 minutes, I am having trouble defining for myself and understanding what others see as poverty.  I will surprise myself by voting a 10 this time around.  7 for your anti-powerty slogan.', '2004-10-31 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(982004, 115077, 28764, '<td valign="top">Ok</td>', 'Ok', '2004-10-31 23:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(982010, 115445, 24511, '<td valign="top">You`ve captured my perception of poverty; seemingly neglected yet oblivious with a  piercing glare.  I get a feeling of choice between recognising versus ignoring needs before us.  The reflection on the wall increases interest.  The bright clean junk food bag contrasts with the shaby clothes and the need to alter priorities.  Should we create the best chip ever or care for our young?  Ten</td>', 'You`ve captured my perception of poverty; seemingly neglected yet oblivious with a  piercing glare.  I get a feeling of choice between recognising versus ignoring needs before us.  The reflection on the wall increases interest.  The bright clean junk food bag contrasts with the shaby clothes and the need to alter priorities.  Should we create the best chip ever or care for our young?  Ten', '2004-10-31 23:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(982031, 115832, 24511, '<td valign="top">Who said poor had to be without color photo a hit with me.  Added to my favorites and eight up your score.  Thanks.</td>', 'Who said poor had to be without color photo a hit with me.  Added to my favorites and eight up your score.  Thanks.', '2004-10-31 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
