(982828, 115732, 8759, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice set up. The place the buck is looks unreal. Though there is a good contrast seems hard to find out the subject. Good luck</td>', 'Good idea and nice set up. The place the buck is looks unreal. Though there is a good contrast seems hard to find out the subject. Good luck', '2004-11-01 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(982830, 115522, 8759, '<td valign="top">Like the sepia. Subject too centered for my taste. If you could cropped it to the left and get rid of that pole (wall) would be better IMO. Than the size is too small to judge it correctly</td>', 'Like the sepia. Subject too centered for my taste. If you could cropped it to the left and get rid of that pole (wall) would be better IMO. Than the size is too small to judge it correctly', '2004-11-01 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
