(982923, 114567, 20056, '<td valign="top">It is interesting how many things people know about the life :)<br/>nice picture, maybe I would have cropped the right side because is distracting... 7 from me.</td>', 'It is interesting how many things people know about the life :)nice picture, maybe I would have cropped the right side because is distracting... 7 from me.', '2004-11-01 10:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(983022, 114656, 14773, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - love the motion blur and the position of the band. I know a few starving artists, so I give this a 7.</td>', 'Nice shot - love the motion blur and the position of the band. I know a few starving artists, so I give this a 7.', '2004-11-01 11:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(983046, 115670, 16829, '<td valign="top">Not sure it fits the Poverty theme that well, but then I''m not a big Protector of Strict Literalism. And I''m a sucker for vibrant color! (9)</td>', 'Not sure it fits the Poverty theme that well, but then I''m not a big Protector of Strict Literalism. And I''m a sucker for vibrant color! (9)', '2004-11-01 11:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(983092, 115669, 28813, '<td valign="top">The shadowed hand really speaks on poverty with the wraps and coins catching the light.</td>', 'The shadowed hand really speaks on poverty with the wraps and coins catching the light.', '2004-11-01 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(983116, 114387, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great Photo, the balance and lighting are very good.<br/>What stops me rating very high is that it does not sufficiently portray poverty for me, he looks more happy than hope...<br/></td>', 'Great Photo, the balance and lighting are very good.What stops me rating very high is that it does not sufficiently portray poverty for me, he looks more happy than hope...', '2004-11-01 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(983156, 114542, 16829, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but, what is this? It doesn''t make any aesthetic or literal sense. It''s just a mess in a rectangular format.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but, what is this? It doesn''t make any aesthetic or literal sense. It''s just a mess in a rectangular format.', '2004-11-01 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(983162, 115740, 26679, '<td valign="top">I can general observation.<br/>1. If you crop the image just below his feet and position him so that he is in the bottom left  corner (rule of thirds), this realy lift the shot.<br/>2. I find the image too bright, for me poverty is encapsulated by dark and moody lighting. I would have tried to use more contrast to try and emulate this.<br/>3. The guy seems to have a great face; it would have been great to have more of that in the frame. This would a better illustration of grit and hardship.<br/>4. As a general observation and you are not alone in this. I do not necessarily associate a musician busking, with poverty, but maybe that is just me.<br/></td>', 'I can general observation.1. If you crop the image just below his feet and position him so that he is in the bottom left  corner (rule of thirds), this realy lift the shot.2. I find the image too bright, for me poverty is encapsulated by dark and moody lighting. I would have tried to use more contrast to try and emulate this.3. The guy seems to have a great face; it would have been great to have more of that in the frame. This would a better illustration of grit and hardship.4. As a general observation and you are not alone in this. I do not necessarily associate a musician busking, with poverty, but maybe that is just me.', '2004-11-01 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(983176, 115494, 26679, '<td valign="top">The anle chose is good and helps with the copmosition.<br/>I however fing the composytion a little too dark. It give the feeling of grit, which is great for this composition, I however feel that more delicate lighting is needed here</td>', 'The anle chose is good and helps with the copmosition.I however fing the composytion a little too dark. It give the feeling of grit, which is great for this composition, I however feel that more delicate lighting is needed here', '2004-11-01 12:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(983188, 115522, 26679, '<td valign="top">Sepia is a good choice here. I would prefer to see the guy moved more to the left or right. (rule of thirds) as this would certainly help with the composition.<br/> <br/>I also find the image a little to small to really see what is going on here.</td>', 'Sepia is a good choice here. I would prefer to see the guy moved more to the left or right. (rule of thirds) as this would certainly help with the composition. I also find the image a little to small to really see what is going on here.', '2004-11-01 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(983196, 115401, 26679, '<td valign="top">What an  interesting face this guy has, its a shame you could not have moved more around to show of it.</td>', 'What an  interesting face this guy has, its a shame you could not have moved more around to show of it.', '2004-11-01 12:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(983201, 115824, 26679, '<td valign="top">Moody, gritty and tough. All this makes a great photograph. However on the poverty association, I need a little more convincing.</td>', 'Moody, gritty and tough. All this makes a great photograph. However on the poverty association, I need a little more convincing.', '2004-11-01 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(983217, 115611, 26679, '<td valign="top">Starved of water and nutrients, is the basic message here.  I would have chosen a different title to poverty, as I feel this looses some of the impact.<br/> <br/>However the image is spot on for me.<br/></td>', 'Starved of water and nutrients, is the basic message here.  I would have chosen a different title to poverty, as I feel this looses some of the impact. However the image is spot on for me.', '2004-11-01 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(983238, 115623, 26679, '<td valign="top">great title, how many times do we all walk past without seeing.</td>', 'great title, how many times do we all walk past without seeing.', '2004-11-01 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(983242, 115716, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great composition here, the only thing that stops this from being a  top photo, is it doesn''t speak povert as well as some of the others. However I love it as a photograph.</td>', 'Great composition here, the only thing that stops this from being a  top photo, is it doesn''t speak povert as well as some of the others. However I love it as a photograph.', '2004-11-01 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(983387, 115674, 20115, '<td valign="top">I think this photo it good but too small--check out tips about getting a larger jpg file on this site.</td>', 'I think this photo it good but too small--check out tips about getting a larger jpg file on this site.', '2004-11-01 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(983419, 115832, 26679, '<td valign="top">The focus is sharp and the tonal colouring is excellent.<br/>The composition however, does not work for me as I feel that the central tree breaks up the image.</td>', 'The focus is sharp and the tonal colouring is excellent.The composition however, does not work for me as I feel that the central tree breaks up the image.', '2004-11-01 14:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(983424, 115803, 26679, '<td valign="top">As a straight photograph, I feel that this image would would offer more compositional strength if the bath were more to the left. As a submission for a poverty chalenge, this misses the mark for me. I get more of an impression of a scrap yard or dumping ground.<br/></td>', 'As a straight photograph, I feel that this image would would offer more compositional strength if the bath were more to the left. As a submission for a poverty chalenge, this misses the mark for me. I get more of an impression of a scrap yard or dumping ground.', '2004-11-01 14:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(983429, 115670, 26679, '<td valign="top">It is certainly bursting with colour, but the modesty is not portrayed very strongly, so as a result the poverty association is lost.<br/> <br/>As a pure photograph, the v ivid colours are warm and inviting, however the cemtral positioning of the window, gives a static impression. I would prefer to see the window croped on either the left or right hand side.</td>', 'It is certainly bursting with colour, but the modesty is not portrayed very strongly, so as a result the poverty association is lost. As a pure photograph, the v ivid colours are warm and inviting, however the cemtral positioning of the window, gives a static impression. I would prefer to see the window croped on either the left or right hand side.', '2004-11-01 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(983437, 115402, 26679, '<td valign="top">I dreamed of having this much food in my fridge when I was a student. It is encouraging to see that you have already drunk all the alcohol.<br/> <br/>Everthing is to central in this picture. I would prefer to see some of the contents to be moved either left or right. Remember the rule of thirds..</td>', 'I dreamed of having this much food in my fridge when I was a student. It is encouraging to see that you have already drunk all the alcohol. Everthing is to central in this picture. I would prefer to see some of the contents to be moved either left or right. Remember the rule of thirds..', '2004-11-01 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(983444, 115833, 26679, '<td valign="top">This image is too central and small for me.<br/>you are alowed upto 640pixels wide. As a rule photographs which are clopser to this size tend to de better.<br/>If you have a larger image, you will then be able to move the boot off centre and utilise the rule of thirds.</td>', 'This image is too central and small for me.you are alowed upto 640pixels wide. As a rule photographs which are clopser to this size tend to de better.If you have a larger image, you will then be able to move the boot off centre and utilise the rule of thirds.', '2004-11-01 14:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(983449, 115471, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good bit of fun, but not to hot the poverty theme.<br/> <br/>As a photograph I feel that the planks square on give a very static feeling, which could have been significantly improved if the wall were shot at an angle. Maybee a side and the front.</td>', 'Good bit of fun, but not to hot the poverty theme. As a photograph I feel that the planks square on give a very static feeling, which could have been significantly improved if the wall were shot at an angle. Maybee a side and the front.', '2004-11-01 14:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
