(985787, 115530, 26361, '<td valign="top">Interesting staging and set-up.  The sepia is a little strong for my tastes, but I like the feel it gives the photo.</td>', 'Interesting staging and set-up.  The sepia is a little strong for my tastes, but I like the feel it gives the photo.', '2004-11-02 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
