(985823, 114351, 26361, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen more of his surroundings to give a better feel of why he is an example of poverty.  Great expression.</td>', 'Would like to have seen more of his surroundings to give a better feel of why he is an example of poverty.  Great expression.', '2004-11-02 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
