(986015, 115796, 25218, '<td valign="top">Does someone live under here? if so, it''s not clear. Nice composition on the subject, but i don''t get the connection to poverty</td>', 'Does someone live under here? if so, it''s not clear. Nice composition on the subject, but i don''t get the connection to poverty', '2004-11-02 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
