(986025, 115791, 25218, '<td valign="top">I originally gave this a 4, but after reviewing the pics, I''m bumping to a 7. This is a unique &amp; creative illustration of poverty - I''m not sure why it came to me now, but after seeing it again, I''m reminded of the poem "The Bean Eaters" by Gwendolyn Brooks.</td>', 'I originally gave this a 4, but after reviewing the pics, I''m bumping to a 7. This is a unique & creative illustration of poverty - I''m not sure why it came to me now, but after seeing it again, I''m reminded of the poem "The Bean Eaters" by Gwendolyn Brooks.', '2004-11-02 12:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(986038, 115696, 26361, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Would love to see it zoomed in a bit to add focus and texture.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Would love to see it zoomed in a bit to add focus and texture.', '2004-11-02 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
