(987996, 115615, 25665, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lbWhaples:</b></div><hr/><i> We''re these people mad you used your flash? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>nope, they turned back and spared some change :)<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.parallax.3x.ro/musician.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.parallax.3x.ro/musician.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.parallax.3x.ro/musician.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-03 09:03:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by lbWhaples: We''re these people mad you used your flash?  nope, they turned back and spared some change :)', '2004-11-03 04:27:35.000000', '2004-11-03 09:03:59.000000', 0),
