(988222, 115841, 17203, '<td valign="top">I had the camera set (incorrectly) to Adobe RGB, hence the dull color, and I think that hurt this shot. I''m suprised at the number of commentors who didn''t understand the moths. Oh well...</td>', 'I had the camera set (incorrectly) to Adobe RGB, hence the dull color, and I think that hurt this shot. I''m suprised at the number of commentors who didn''t understand the moths. Oh well...', '2004-11-03 08:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
