(988354, 115077, 21714, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the Blue. I understand it wasn''t easy for you to photograph a person in that situation. But someone has to capture those images and show the world. Now it''s there for the world to see. Well done.<br/> <br/>edit: typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-03 10:20:00.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the Blue. I understand it wasn''t easy for you to photograph a person in that situation. But someone has to capture those images and show the world. Now it''s there for the world to see. Well done. edit: typo', '2004-11-03 09:25:42.000000', '2004-11-03 10:20:00.000000', 0),
(988436, 115077, 20941, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon for this dramatic image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon for this dramatic image.', '2004-11-03 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(988460, 115077, 14773, '<td valign="top">really great, amazing shot.  I''m not sure of the moral issues you''re having with taking it in the first place. For the sake of spreading awareness I think what you did was right, and I don''t think you did it with the intention of winning a ribbon or getting recognition.<br/> <br/>Again, great work.</td>', 'really great, amazing shot.  I''m not sure of the moral issues you''re having with taking it in the first place. For the sake of spreading awareness I think what you did was right, and I don''t think you did it with the intention of winning a ribbon or getting recognition. Again, great work.', '2004-11-03 10:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(988525, 114834, 12962, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 20.  Truly represents poverty in the Philippines.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 20.  Truly represents poverty in the Philippines.', '2004-11-03 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(988675, 115469, 10428, '<td valign="top">I was surprised about how many people didn''t realize what this picture/title was trying to say: that college costs a bunch of money and makes people poor.  Oh well, I guess I have a better knowledge that I should more tightly bind my photos to the contest title.</td>', 'I was surprised about how many people didn''t realize what this picture/title was trying to say: that college costs a bunch of money and makes people poor.  Oh well, I guess I have a better knowledge that I should more tightly bind my photos to the contest title.', '2004-11-03 11:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
