(993076, 115781, 16862, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. The frame is not a part of the picture, It''s a frame. Maybe it was too big and maybe not. Try to look at the picture, this is a picture contest, not a frame contest.   The frame was this wide cause I had to make a certain border between the gray background and the picture.  This picture looses it''s intensity if it''s surrounded by gray color.    I would understand some of these "frame" comments if the color was green og red but not like this</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. The frame is not a part of the picture, It''s a frame. Maybe it was too big and maybe not. Try to look at the picture, this is a picture contest, not a frame contest.   The frame was this wide cause I had to make a certain border between the gray background and the picture.  This picture looses it''s intensity if it''s surrounded by gray color.    I would understand some of these "frame" comments if the color was green og red but not like this', '2004-11-05 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 0),
