(1306461, 114387, 14986, '<td valign="top">Not sure how well this met the challenge, but the shot itself is very well done.  His expression is great.  I like that he has a hint of a smile, not just a sorrowful "pity me" sort of look.  I like the focus on his eye, the tones and the composition.  Well done.</td>', 'Not sure how well this met the challenge, but the shot itself is very well done.  His expression is great.  I like that he has a hint of a smile, not just a sorrowful "pity me" sort of look.  I like the focus on his eye, the tones and the composition.  Well done.', '2005-04-20 00:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
